OL,3,GNEWSAKids charity receives funding for
OL,4,Atherapy project
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity has received funding to offer
OL,7,Ftherapeutic support to help vulnerable
OL,8,Fchildren overcome trauma with the aim
OL,9,Fof reducing future harm.
OL,11,FThe KidsAid Foundation, based in
OL,12,FNorthampton, has been awarded #10,000
OL,13,Ffrom the office of Northamptonshire's
OL,14,Fpolice, fire and crime commissioner
OL,15,F(PFCC), for 120 specialist one-to-one
OL,16,Ftherapy sessions as part of its
OL,17,FBreaking the Cycle project.
OL,19,FThe support will be available for any
OL,20,Fchild aged two to 18 who is thought to
OL,21,Fbe at risk of exploitation, antisocial
OL,22,Fbehaviour and offending.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
