OL,3,GNEWSAKids charity receives funding for
OL,4,Atherapy project
OL,5,
OL,6,FKerry Mainwaring, the charity's
OL,7,Fdevelopment manager, said the funding
OL,8,Fwould give the children "the
OL,9,Fopportunity to be heard, understood and
OL,10,Fsupported to heal".
